## Prepositions with Pronouns

<section name="prep-pronouns">
<rule>Weak forms (με, σε) go before verbs only. After a preposition, use the long emphatic forms.</rule>

Rendered as neutral ExamplePills (no case colour):

| Greek         | English      |
|---------------|--------------|
| για μένα      | for me       |
| με σένα       | with you     |
| από αυτόν     | from him     |
| χωρίς εμάς    | without us   |
| μαζί σου      | with you (together) |

</section>

